  "details": "Description\n\nIcons return to the wrong position after hiding a feature submenu (e.g. Behavior). After returning, the icons end up slightly lower than before the first opening.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\n0. Make sure no submenu in the camera menu has been opened during the entire game session\n\n1. Open Quick Menu\n\n2. Double-click the camera tab\n\n3. Open the camera menu\n\n4. Open the submenu of any feature (e.g., Photo Resolution (the bug is most noticeable there))\n\n5. Close the submenu\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p1-1920-5a72154dad-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-08_15-16-29.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_350eb5ba-aeb4-4212-bfd5-f7c54c746a9b/1/file)",
